    <h1>Bus Matrix and Principles</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p style=3D"">The model will follow the Dimensional Modelling metho=
dology, the reason described in section 4. A precursor to aid modelling is =
to use a simple Business (Bus) Matrix, which maps measures (facts) to conte=
xt (dimensions). Below is our existing Matrix :</p>
